TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium in pure water
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g) -0.7 10
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -solution true
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -ionic_strength true
    -totals Fe S Ca
END
